#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:38
msgid "Consuming SolarWinds in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:40
msgid ""
"On saving your new integration, SolarWinds networks will be synced and "
"can be viewed by navigating to ``Infrastructure > Network > IP POOLS``. "
"They're also viewable from the detail section of the SolarWinds "
"integration at ``Infrastructure > Network > INTEGRATIONS > (your "
"SolarWinds integration) > NETWORK POOLS``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:42
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"/images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/networkpools.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:45
msgid ""
"Host records can also be viewed here by clicking on the name of a "
"SolarWinds network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:47
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"/images/integration_guides/networking/solarwinds/hostrecords.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:50
msgid ""
"|morpheus| SolarWinds integration does not support zone record syncing "
"despite the presence of the ZONES tab on the integration detail page. "
"This is a UI feature carried over from other networking integrations and "
"is not supported at this time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:53
msgid "Adding IP Pools to Networks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:55
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can automatically assign the next available SolarWinds IP in "
"an IP/Network Pool and create the corresponding DNS records. |morpheus| "
"will also remove the records upon teardown. To enable this, add an "
"SolarWinds IP/Network Pool to the `Network Pool` section on a Network(s)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/solarwinds.rst:57
